WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.183
- Hello everyone!

00:00:01.183 --> 00:00:05.984
So welcome to episode number
two of Unlocking Lily.

00:00:05.984 --> 00:00:07.959
So I quit my day job

00:00:07.959 --> 00:00:11.136
to pursue my dream in
becoming a public speaker

00:00:11.136 --> 00:00:14.347
and you guys are all coming
along with me for the ride.

00:00:14.347 --> 00:00:16.597
(swishing)

00:00:17.502 --> 00:00:21.074
So my first challenge was
doing the entpresso video.

00:00:21.074 --> 00:00:23.279
One of the most important
goals that I have

00:00:23.279 --> 00:00:25.883
is to become a great storyteller.

00:00:25.883 --> 00:00:28.636
I want to be able to
tell compelling stories

00:00:28.636 --> 00:00:30.610
where people feel a little bit changed

00:00:30.610 --> 00:00:32.213
after listening to me.

00:00:32.213 --> 00:00:33.605
So with the entpresso video,

00:00:33.605 --> 00:00:36.290
I'm able to take someone's message,

00:00:36.290 --> 00:00:39.179
like Gwen Stefani's message
in finding who you are,

00:00:39.179 --> 00:00:42.557
and use my own stories to actually be able

00:00:42.557 --> 00:00:45.250
to give you guys a teachable lesson.

00:00:45.250 --> 00:00:46.585
Good morning believe nation.

00:00:46.585 --> 00:00:49.543
Today's message is find who you are,

00:00:49.543 --> 00:00:51.494
over to you Gwen Stefani.

00:00:51.494 --> 00:00:56.311
So when I first found out
that I will be talking about

00:00:56.311 --> 00:00:57.728
find who you are,

00:00:59.330 --> 00:01:01.330
I got so excited because

00:01:02.186 --> 00:01:06.763
being on the path of
self-discovery and self-awareness

00:01:06.763 --> 00:01:08.607
has been so important to me and

00:01:08.607 --> 00:01:11.472
has been my focus for the past two years,

00:01:11.472 --> 00:01:14.422
I was so, so looking
forward to actually sharing

00:01:14.422 --> 00:01:17.259
all of that with you guys as well.

00:01:17.259 --> 00:01:18.581
And in a weird way,

00:01:18.581 --> 00:01:19.414
I thought

00:01:20.477 --> 00:01:24.335
that Evan picked it on purpose for me

00:01:24.335 --> 00:01:26.616
because he knew that it would mean a lot.

00:01:26.616 --> 00:01:27.449
I don't know.

00:01:27.449 --> 00:01:28.282
Maybe he did, maybe he didn't.

00:01:28.282 --> 00:01:29.115
Maybe it was pure coincidence.

00:01:29.115 --> 00:01:30.361
But I will find out from him.

00:01:30.361 --> 00:01:33.568
I was really, really happy about that.

00:01:33.568 --> 00:01:36.564
This has been a path of
mine for the past few years

00:01:36.564 --> 00:01:40.727
and I really wanted to share my struggles,

00:01:40.727 --> 00:01:42.021
my failures around it,

00:01:42.021 --> 00:01:43.705
as well as to let you know that

00:01:43.705 --> 00:01:45.142
things do get better.

00:01:45.142 --> 00:01:47.848
Things doesn't always have to be that way.

00:01:47.848 --> 00:01:50.615
And I wanted you to learn
from my experiences.

00:01:50.615 --> 00:01:54.243
So knowing all that, I got
really excited on the day of.

00:01:54.243 --> 00:01:56.576
And then it took four hours.

00:01:57.475 --> 00:01:59.982
I don't know what it is with the camera

00:01:59.982 --> 00:02:01.347
being in front of your face,

00:02:01.347 --> 00:02:03.618
as soon as a camera's in front of my face

00:02:03.618 --> 00:02:06.684
I feel like I forget everything.

00:02:06.684 --> 00:02:09.331
So all in all, it took two days to

00:02:09.331 --> 00:02:12.386
actually get the entire video out.

00:02:12.386 --> 00:02:15.250
So the first day I spent two hours

00:02:15.250 --> 00:02:17.254
going over and over what I'm going to say,

00:02:17.254 --> 00:02:20.895
rehearsing it in my head and out loud,

00:02:20.895 --> 00:02:23.308
and then once I got in front of the camera

00:02:23.308 --> 00:02:26.852
it took me another two
hours to actually record

00:02:26.852 --> 00:02:29.349
because I still get very, very nervous

00:02:29.349 --> 00:02:31.252
when the camera's in front of my face.

00:02:31.252 --> 00:02:33.667
Right now I feel really nervous.

00:02:33.667 --> 00:02:36.667
And finally, finally, 28 times after

00:02:38.841 --> 00:02:40.935
I got the first final draft.

00:02:40.935 --> 00:02:42.197
I got really... I was so proud.

00:02:42.197 --> 00:02:44.506
I was so proud. Oh my god,
I'm so proud of myself

00:02:44.506 --> 00:02:46.925
and I'm going to really
send it off to Evan

00:02:46.925 --> 00:02:49.568
and he's going to be so
impressed with me because,

00:02:49.568 --> 00:02:52.325
you know, I did such a
good job and everything.

00:02:52.325 --> 00:02:53.908
Which I did, which I did.

00:02:53.908 --> 00:02:58.300
So I sent it over to him
and he gave me feedback.

00:02:58.300 --> 00:03:00.338
So, by the way, all the
videos that you guys see

00:03:00.338 --> 00:03:03.865
of me on his channel, he looks over.

00:03:03.865 --> 00:03:06.419
He looks at it before
it actually goes live.

00:03:06.419 --> 00:03:09.123
And he sends me feedback of
things I need to work on,

00:03:09.123 --> 00:03:11.203
as well as he sends me feedback

00:03:11.203 --> 00:03:12.428
on the things I did well as well.

00:03:12.428 --> 00:03:15.772
So he did the same thing for this video.

00:03:15.772 --> 00:03:19.643
But there was one thing in
particular that really just, ugh,

00:03:19.643 --> 00:03:22.310
just got to me, was when he said

00:03:23.747 --> 00:03:27.131
that right now you're saying
a lot of general things

00:03:27.131 --> 00:03:29.712
and I don't feel what you're feeling.

00:03:29.712 --> 00:03:32.585
And that's the entire thing, wasn't it.

00:03:32.585 --> 00:03:34.733
I want to be a good storyteller

00:03:34.733 --> 00:03:36.129
and he's not feeling what I'm feeling.

00:03:36.129 --> 00:03:38.111
That is not the point of this.

00:03:38.111 --> 00:03:42.028
I haven't done something
right because of that.

00:03:42.894 --> 00:03:44.065
And then when I thought about it,

00:03:44.065 --> 00:03:47.106
I was like okay, why, why isn't
he feeling what I'm feeling?

00:03:47.106 --> 00:03:49.356
At that moment, I realized,

00:03:51.829 --> 00:03:55.156
that in order to have a powerful story,

00:03:55.156 --> 00:03:58.040
I have to be specific
about the moments in time.

00:03:58.040 --> 00:04:01.549
I have to be specific
about that pivotal moment

00:04:01.549 --> 00:04:05.716
that caused me to make a
change to find out who I am.

00:04:07.157 --> 00:04:08.974
So I suggested to rerecord

00:04:08.974 --> 00:04:11.948
and being the really
encouraging guy that he is

00:04:11.948 --> 00:04:13.930
he's like yeah, of course, go for it.

00:04:13.930 --> 00:04:16.763
So the next day, after 24 hours of

00:04:17.770 --> 00:04:21.472
reflecting what happened
to cause that change,

00:04:21.472 --> 00:04:24.331
I decided to go in front of the camera.

00:04:24.331 --> 00:04:28.167
And then when I did, I wasn't sure if

00:04:28.167 --> 00:04:32.089
I wanted to share my story
specifically with you guys.

00:04:32.089 --> 00:04:33.949
I was saying too many general things

00:04:33.949 --> 00:04:36.242
to dance around the idea of

00:04:36.242 --> 00:04:38.776
the real, hard hitting questions.

00:04:38.776 --> 00:04:41.693
And the hard hitting questions was,

00:04:42.877 --> 00:04:44.665
what caused me to change,

00:04:44.665 --> 00:04:47.906
was I asked myself some really, really

00:04:47.906 --> 00:04:50.618
transparent questions about myself.

00:04:50.618 --> 00:04:54.035
I had to reveal that my job, at the time,

00:04:54.929 --> 00:04:56.557
was making me miserable.

00:04:56.557 --> 00:05:00.724
I had to reveal a part of me
that I wasn't so proud of,

00:05:02.733 --> 00:05:06.554
specifically the part of me
that picked a certain job

00:05:06.554 --> 00:05:10.713
because she thought that
money would make her happy,

00:05:10.713 --> 00:05:11.758
you know?

00:05:11.758 --> 00:05:15.037
Also staying with a job for so long,

00:05:15.037 --> 00:05:17.792
knowing that you're
miserable and you're unhappy

00:05:17.792 --> 00:05:19.576
and you have no passion for it, you know,

00:05:19.576 --> 00:05:21.250
what would people think of me?

00:05:21.250 --> 00:05:22.752
People are thinking like
you know better, why?

00:05:22.752 --> 00:05:26.433
And I was so afraid of getting judged

00:05:26.433 --> 00:05:30.848
that I didn't want to share
the specifics of my story.

00:05:30.848 --> 00:05:31.858
And then I started thinking and I'm like

00:05:31.858 --> 00:05:35.702
I really don't want to hurt
people's feelings either

00:05:35.702 --> 00:05:36.954
because a lot of people that I worked with

00:05:36.954 --> 00:05:38.951
are going to be watching my videos.

00:05:38.951 --> 00:05:40.524
I don't want them to think that, you know,

00:05:40.524 --> 00:05:42.270
I was miserable when I was working there

00:05:42.270 --> 00:05:45.834
and they had something to do with it.

00:05:45.834 --> 00:05:49.662
Or people who are doing the
same job that I was doing,

00:05:49.662 --> 00:05:52.747
I don't want them to
think that it's a bad job,

00:05:52.747 --> 00:05:53.580
or it makes people miserable.

00:05:53.580 --> 00:05:55.258
The only reason why I was miserable

00:05:55.258 --> 00:05:56.688
is because I was doing something that

00:05:56.688 --> 00:05:59.255
I do not have passion for and that's it.

00:05:59.255 --> 00:06:02.787
So I had to really, really
wrestle with this idea,

00:06:02.787 --> 00:06:04.600
like do I share? Do I not share?

00:06:04.600 --> 00:06:07.275
I don't know. Maybe I
should share another story.

00:06:07.275 --> 00:06:11.275
And then I came to the
realization of something.

00:06:12.889 --> 00:06:16.263
I signed a contract with you guys.

00:06:16.263 --> 00:06:18.504
The first day when I got
in front of the camera

00:06:18.504 --> 00:06:21.671
and I told you that I'm going to share

00:06:22.613 --> 00:06:25.629
everything about my journey with you,

00:06:25.629 --> 00:06:26.942
my failures, my struggles,
my joy, my celebration.

00:06:26.942 --> 00:06:27.775
Everything.

00:06:27.775 --> 00:06:29.549
This means this story too.

00:06:29.549 --> 00:06:32.586
I have to tell you the story
what caused me to change.

00:06:32.586 --> 00:06:35.109
Everything that I go
through, I can't edit it.

00:06:35.109 --> 00:06:36.607
I can't edit certain parts of my life

00:06:36.607 --> 00:06:39.907
and show you certain parts and
not show you certain parts.

00:06:39.907 --> 00:06:41.301
I had to share.

00:06:41.301 --> 00:06:44.312
And I summed up the courage to

00:06:44.312 --> 00:06:45.883
actually do the video the next day.

00:06:45.883 --> 00:06:46.716
So I did.

00:06:46.716 --> 00:06:48.948
I got in front of the camera the next day

00:06:48.948 --> 00:06:53.115
and I told my whole story around
how I found who I am today.

00:06:55.024 --> 00:06:58.520
And I think the impact was so positive

00:06:58.520 --> 00:07:02.008
because you guys responded to the video

00:07:02.008 --> 00:07:03.103
in such loving, encouraging words,

00:07:03.103 --> 00:07:04.453
and I actually really wanted to

00:07:04.453 --> 00:07:07.227
share some of the comments
with you right now.

00:07:07.227 --> 00:07:11.060
So the first comment
comes from Steph Reveron.

00:07:24.554 --> 00:07:25.387
Thank you Steph!

00:07:25.387 --> 00:07:26.220
I remember you.

00:07:26.220 --> 00:07:27.303
You're the first one that came to

00:07:27.303 --> 00:07:30.600
that Zumba class in December, I remember.

00:07:30.600 --> 00:07:31.566
And, I miss you too.

00:07:31.566 --> 00:07:32.920
So if you ever come to Toronto,

00:07:32.920 --> 00:07:34.879
please come by Toronto Dance Salsa

00:07:34.879 --> 00:07:37.927
and just come by and visit
and say hi or take a class.

00:07:37.927 --> 00:07:39.824
Whatever you want to
do, just come by, okay?

00:07:39.824 --> 00:07:41.390
I would love to see you again.

00:07:41.390 --> 00:07:44.557
The next one comes from Paula Meneses.

00:07:54.564 --> 00:07:57.631
Paula Meneses is one of the first people

00:07:57.631 --> 00:08:01.158
to actually write on
my intro video as well,

00:08:01.158 --> 00:08:04.241
so Paula, honestly, your feedback and

00:08:05.498 --> 00:08:09.043
your encouragement and your
words mean so, so much to me.

00:08:09.043 --> 00:08:10.928
So thank you so much Paula.

00:08:10.928 --> 00:08:14.011
The last one comes from scholastic01.

00:08:20.687 --> 00:08:24.832
Scholastic01, now that
you know that I struggled

00:08:24.832 --> 00:08:27.558
really hard with whether or not

00:08:27.558 --> 00:08:30.400
I should tell my whole
story with you guys,

00:08:30.400 --> 00:08:33.705
your words right now made
me feel more confident

00:08:33.705 --> 00:08:35.344
that I did the right thing.

00:08:35.344 --> 00:08:39.243
So scholastic01, thank you
again for writing this comment.

00:08:39.243 --> 00:08:42.089
So those are the three, but I
do have one honorable mention,

00:08:42.089 --> 00:08:44.779
that was not on YouTube,
it's actually on Facebook.

00:08:44.779 --> 00:08:46.730
It comes from my mom.

00:08:46.730 --> 00:08:48.991
My mom recently discovered social media

00:08:48.991 --> 00:08:52.158
and she's been very, very active on it

00:08:54.197 --> 00:08:57.831
and she wrote on the video
that Evan shared on Facebook

00:08:57.831 --> 00:09:01.963
was amazing with two smiley face emojis.

00:09:01.963 --> 00:09:05.320
My mom is so funny and so humorous

00:09:05.320 --> 00:09:07.897
and such a wonderful human being.

00:09:07.897 --> 00:09:11.468
And she honestly is the
most generous person

00:09:11.468 --> 00:09:12.739
I have ever known in my life.

00:09:12.739 --> 00:09:15.322
She's the reason why I can give

00:09:16.804 --> 00:09:19.544
and she taught me one
very important lesson,

00:09:19.544 --> 00:09:23.403
is to always give without
expecting anything in return

00:09:23.403 --> 00:09:26.720
and I will always take
it everywhere with me.

00:09:26.720 --> 00:09:30.600
So Mom, thank you so
much. I love you. Love you

00:09:30.600 --> 00:09:32.168
So my challenge for next week

00:09:32.168 --> 00:09:35.143
is to research 20 inspirational speakers

00:09:35.143 --> 00:09:36.973
that I look up to.

00:09:36.973 --> 00:09:38.969
So right now, I have this big goal, right?

00:09:38.969 --> 00:09:41.224
This big goal of stepping on stage and

00:09:41.224 --> 00:09:42.986
speaking to thousands of people.

00:09:42.986 --> 00:09:47.426
But I don't really know which
specific paths I can take.

00:09:47.426 --> 00:09:50.361
And the truth is I can figure
everything out on my own.

00:09:50.361 --> 00:09:51.296
I can, you know?

00:09:51.296 --> 00:09:53.728
But it will take me a very long time.

00:09:53.728 --> 00:09:56.592
It will take me maybe five
years, ten years, fifteen years.

00:09:56.592 --> 00:09:57.425
I don't know.

00:09:57.425 --> 00:09:59.015
And the truth is, a lot of times,

00:09:59.015 --> 00:10:01.720
you and I don't have that kind of time

00:10:01.720 --> 00:10:03.642
to actually figure things out.

00:10:03.642 --> 00:10:05.399
So the best thing to do in that case

00:10:05.399 --> 00:10:08.169
is actually look at people
who have gone through

00:10:08.169 --> 00:10:10.488
what we want to go through,
whatever that mission is,

00:10:10.488 --> 00:10:12.862
in my case, being a public speaker.

00:10:12.862 --> 00:10:14.478
And see what their breakthroughs were

00:10:14.478 --> 00:10:17.976
and see what their a-ha moments were

00:10:17.976 --> 00:10:19.181
and see their mistakes so that way

00:10:19.181 --> 00:10:21.631
we don't make the same mistakes as well.

00:10:21.631 --> 00:10:23.822
So that's going to be all next week.

00:10:23.822 --> 00:10:25.677
I'm going to share with you my research.

00:10:25.677 --> 00:10:26.699
I'm going to share with you all

00:10:26.699 --> 00:10:28.155
the breakthroughs that these people had

00:10:28.155 --> 00:10:31.238
and how my path is going to change or

00:10:32.160 --> 00:10:34.368
develop as a result of it.

00:10:34.368 --> 00:10:35.800
So actually, I have a
question for you guys.

00:10:35.800 --> 00:10:38.357
When was the last time you shared

00:10:38.357 --> 00:10:41.362
a specific story with someone and

00:10:41.362 --> 00:10:43.450
if you're willing, and comfortable,

00:10:43.450 --> 00:10:45.219
I would love to see it in the comments

00:10:45.219 --> 00:10:47.522
of what the story was.

00:10:47.522 --> 00:10:49.637
You guys have been so
open with your stories

00:10:49.637 --> 00:10:51.113
and I love reading it.

00:10:51.113 --> 00:10:54.126
So the more stories you share, the better.

00:10:54.126 --> 00:10:55.778
And I'll be looking forward in

00:10:55.778 --> 00:10:57.908
reading all your comments below.

00:10:57.908 --> 00:11:01.861
Once again, I am so,
so incredibly grateful

00:11:01.861 --> 00:11:03.579
for all the wonderful comments,

00:11:03.579 --> 00:11:06.156
the love, the encouragement, the support

00:11:06.156 --> 00:11:09.107
that's been pouring in over
the past couple of weeks.

00:11:09.107 --> 00:11:10.946
You guys are incredible.

00:11:10.946 --> 00:11:12.871
I couldn't ask for more.

00:11:12.871 --> 00:11:14.171
Thank you, thank you so much

00:11:14.171 --> 00:11:16.203
and I will see you guys very soon.

00:11:16.203 --> 00:11:18.870
(kissing sound)

